    test(jeandle): cover expensive context cache reuse
    
    Exercise same-block FinalTypes reuse, cross-block PathFacts prefix reuse, and query-mutate-query retention against fresh DT/LVI/cache references. Add a bounded native replay with separate diagnostics and configurable paired rounds.

